/-!
# `chacha20poly1305` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `chacha20poly1305` crate:

* `ChaCha20Poly1305.Spec.AEAD`: the forms of the `aead` crate that keep the tag after the
  ciphertext, built on RFC 8439 in `Standards/RFC/ChaCha20Poly1305/`;
* `ChaCha20Poly1305.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by
  `scripts/extract.py`;
* `ChaCha20Poly1305.Spec.Program`: call semantics of each extracted entry point (valid calls,
  output readers, and the memory regions a call may change);
* `ChaCha20Poly1305.Spec.Program.Routine`: the wrappers' `Routine` records and `hasRoom`, the part
  of the call semantics the tests import, as it needs no program image.

`ChaCha20Poly1305.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
